<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/business.css"></head><body><%- include('../partials/admin_header') %><main class="studio-admin"><h1>Delivery Partner Settings</h1><p>Add the real courier partners your store supports. Enabled means store-supported, regardless of order time or courier opening hours. Select Bengaluru, Mumbai, or both below. Orders can be placed at any time; parcels are handed over during the next pickup/working period. Manage state mappings in <a href="/admin/settings/delivery">Zone / Hub Settings</a>. Lower priority numbers appear first.</p><% ['south','north'].forEach(id=>{ const zone=regions.find(row=>row._id===id); if(!zone)return; %><section class="studio-section"><h2><%= zone.dispatch_location.toUpperCase() %> HUB ? <%= zone.name.toUpperCase() %></h2><ul><% items.filter(item=>(zone.partner_ids || []).includes(item._id)).forEach(item=>{ %><li><%= item.name %> ? <%= item.active?'Enabled':'Disabled' %></li><% }) %></ul><p>Edit supported hubs and enabled status in the partner forms below.</p></section><% }) %><% [...items,{name:'',priority:100,pincodes:[]}].forEach(item=>{ %><section class="studio-section"><h2><%= item.name || 'Add Courier' %></h2><form method="post" action="/admin/settings/couriers" class="studio-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="courier_id" value="<%= item._id || '' %>"><label>Partner name<input name="name" maxlength="100" value="<%= item.name %>" required></label><fieldset><legend>Supported Hubs (select both for Both)</legend><% regions.filter(zone=>['south','north'].includes(zone._id)).forEach(zone=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="hub_ids" value="<%= zone._id %>" <%= (zone.partner_ids || []).includes(item._id)?'checked':'' %>><%= zone.dispatch_location %> (<%= zone.name %>)</label><% }) %></fieldset><label>Website URL<input name="website_url" value="<%= item.website_url || '' %>"></label><label>Tracking URL (optional {awb} placeholder)<input name="tracking_url" value="<%= item.tracking_url || '' %>"></label><label>Contact info<input name="contact" maxlength="300" value="<%= item.contact || '' %>"></label><label>Estimated delivery minimum days<input name="delivery_min_days" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="<%= item.delivery_min_days ?? '' %>"></label><label>Estimated delivery maximum days<input name="delivery_max_days" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="<%= item.delivery_max_days ?? '' %>"></label><label>Priority<input name="priority" type="number" min="0" max="10000" value="<%= item.priority %>" required></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%= item.active?'checked':'' %>> Enabled ? this store supports this partner</label><button>Save Partner</button></form></section><% }) %></main></body></html>
